# Production build configuration for the dashboard.
#
# Committed on purpose. Neither value is a secret: the anon key is designed to
# ship inside the JavaScript bundle where any visitor can read it, and Row
# Level Security is what actually protects the data. Anything that genuinely
# is a secret - the service role key above all - belongs in Supabase Edge
# Function secrets or Cloudflare Worker secrets, never here.
#
# It lives in the repo because the alternative cost three broken deployments.
# Cloudflare has two variable lists that look alike, and VITE_ values set in
# the runtime one never reach the build, producing a site that deploys
# successfully and then renders nothing. A file in the repo cannot be put in
# the wrong list.
#
# Precedence: a real environment variable still wins over this file, so the
# Cloudflare build variables - which are also set - override it. This is the
# floor, not the override. Change the Supabase project and you must change it
# in both places, or in neither and only here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://yyzrhizisdjpwcnnqiwr.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6Inl5enJoaXppc2RqcHdjbm5xaXdyIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODk2NTM5NjMsImV4cCI6MjEwNTIyOTk2M30.11ndvkz5wFQq9qwCLgK50e9Bs6xConDQz-u_POi1ZrU
